    "credit": "FIRST's 2026-27 BIOGLOW mat artwork with the mission numbers added, read from jaimeyu/fll_sim (GPL-3.0) at commit b04157cb. It is the colour mat; it is not ours to ship, so the studio downloads it for you and keeps it outside the repository."
